WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:06.698
Gildong landed in the yard at Lord Hong's house.

2
00:00:06.699 --> 00:00:12.646
Inhyun screamed.

3
00:00:12.647 --> 00:00:18.406
"Don't hurt me, Gildong! I know all about your powers."

4
00:00:18.407 --> 00:00:21.576
"I'm not here to hurt you," Gildong said.

5
00:00:21.577 --> 00:00:24.459
"I'm here to see Lord Hong."

6
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.652
Inhyun scowled.

7
00:00:26.653 --> 00:00:32.170
"He's sick and in trouble because of you. You're evil."

8
00:00:32.171 --> 00:00:38.034
"I'm not evil. The Hwalbindang are helping people," Gildong said.

9
00:00:38.035 --> 00:00:41.990
"You're lying!" Inhyun waved his arms.

10
00:00:41.991 --> 00:00:45.223
"Chief Heup! Gildong is here!"

11
00:00:45.224 --> 00:00:49.318
Heup rushed into the yard with two men.

12
00:00:49.319 --> 00:00:58.111
They held out spears and ran toward Gildong and Inhyun.

13
00:00:58.112 --> 00:01:06.210
"Wind gust!" Gildong swung his fan and a heavy wind blew, swirling dust everywhere.

14
00:01:06.211 --> 00:01:11.254
The men fell down, and their weapons blew away.

15
00:01:11.255 --> 00:01:16.423
"Get up and capture him!" Heup shouted.

16
00:01:16.424 --> 00:01:22.839
As the dust cleared, Heup's men charged toward Gildong and Inhyun again.

17
00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:29.184
Gildong held his fan. "Switch!"

18
00:01:29.185 --> 00:01:33.598
Inhyun backed toward the wall while Gildong froze.

19
00:01:33.599 --> 00:01:39.096
The men tackled Gildong and held him down.

20
00:01:39.097 --> 00:01:43.510
Heup smiled. "Got you, Gildong!"

21
00:01:43.511 --> 00:01:47.938
Suddenly there was a scream at the gate.

22
00:01:47.939 --> 00:01:52.874
"Let my son go!" Lady Yoo shouted.

23
00:01:52.875 --> 00:01:56.109
Heup looked again at the boy on the ground.

24
00:01:56.110 --> 00:02:00.137
It wasn't Gildong—it was Inhyun.

25
00:02:00.138 --> 00:02:06.571
Heup groaned.

26
00:02:06.572 --> 00:02:11.923
"Gildong got away!"

27
00:02:11.924 --> 00:02:16.118
Gildong tried to think of another plan for helping his father.

28
00:02:16.119 --> 00:02:19.292
But then he heard more news.

29
00:02:19.293 --> 00:02:25.429
The king had sent Lord Hong to prison.

30
00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:30.090
One night Gildong looked up at the moon.

31
00:02:30.091 --> 00:02:33.255
"I have to free Lord Hong," he thought.

32
00:02:33.256 --> 00:02:37.165
"If I fail, the king will find a worse punishment for him.

33
00:02:37.166 --> 00:02:42.328
But how can I free him without getting captured?"

34
00:02:42.329 --> 00:02:46.746
The next morning he saw Soonhee and Boknam.

35
00:02:46.747 --> 00:02:50.373
They were playing with dolls made of straw.

36
00:02:50.374 --> 00:02:55.547
Boknam held up a doll. "I am Hong Gildong!"

37
00:02:55.548 --> 00:02:59.377
"Four of you go north!" Soonhee said.

38
00:02:59.378 --> 00:03:01.685
"Three of you go south!

39
00:03:01.686 --> 00:03:04.670
Punish bad people!"

40
00:03:04.671 --> 00:03:08.682
She waved the dolls around.

41
00:03:08.683 --> 00:03:15.971
Gildong looked at the dolls. "That's it!"

42
00:03:15.972 --> 00:03:20.054
Gildong arrived at the palace gate.

43
00:03:20.055 --> 00:03:24.305
"I am Hong Gildong, leader of the Hwalbindang."

44
00:03:24.306 --> 00:03:27.365
The guards pointed their spears at him.

45
00:03:27.366 --> 00:03:32.974
Gildong raised his hands. "I am here to surrender."

46
00:03:32.975 --> 00:03:35.315
The gate captain grinned.

47
00:03:35.316 --> 00:03:40.740
"I have Gildong! The king will be so pleased!"

48
00:03:40.741 --> 00:03:47.444
He rushed into the palace.

49
00:03:47.445 --> 00:03:50.824
The king was meeting with the police chief.

50
00:03:50.825 --> 00:03:53.901
The captain bowed.

51
00:03:53.902 --> 00:03:59.741
"Your Majesty, Hong Gildong has surrendered at the gate!"

52
00:03:59.742 --> 00:04:07.252
"Gildong is playing tricks on us again!" the king cried.

53
00:04:07.253 --> 00:04:10.951
"How many is that now, Chief Heup?"

54
00:04:10.952 --> 00:04:16.601
"That makes seven, sir." Heup groaned.

55
00:04:16.602 --> 00:04:23.907
"So far seven Gildongs have surrendered!"

